repository-code: "https://github.com/myaslioglu/tesseract-alife"
abstract: >-
  An artificial-life system in which each organism is a file that carries its
  own genome: an arithmetic expression, or a small transformer with its weights,
  architecture and replay memory. Organisms earn energy on a Mandelbrot-set
  habitat, reproduce with mutation, prey on foreign neighbours, and grow new
  attention layers through a function-preserving morph. Includes control arms
  (random survival, a single brain trained alone) and a dependency-free
  self-replicating organism.
keywords:
  - artificial life
  - self-replication
  - neuroevolution
  - transformers
  - induction heads
  - predation
  - kin selection
  - Mandelbrot set
